{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Plan-review remediation: dropped --until/automatic expiry because old readers cannot honor it consistently; corrected the overbroad pause claim to explicitly allow read-only legacy reconcile-check while blocking every mutating legacy mode; named the workflow exit-4 branch; defined blank/idempotent/conflicting pause and unpaused-resume behavior; retained existing expected-old-oid CAS with explicit conflict surfacing; committed to no check_phase_gate rename; and expanded file impact to all production, CLI, workflow, and oracle sites. This also makes compatibility with old binaries and vocabulary an explicit acceptance contract."},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1786207831890060001,"uuid":"a8ae4103-410b-4db0-8d60-cc4f51a50192"}